note Exercism-style exercise "pangram": https://exercism.org/tracks/python/exercises/pangram
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note ispangram is true when s contains every letter a .. z at least once, ignoring case.
note Check it with: sh exercise.sh exercises/pangram
om2
fn ispangram s view uchar * to bool
seen = new uchar 26 0
n = ulong 0
for i ulong len s
c = get s i
if and ge c 65 le c 90
c = add c 32
end
if and ge c 97 le c 122
k = ulong sub c 97
if eq get seen k 0
put seen k 1
n = add n 1
end
end
end
ret eq n 26
end
